  "label": "Synthetic demo",
  "alt": "Eight gray synthetic CT crops of the same papyrus windings in a two by four grid: the plain sheet, then with waviness, glued joins where the sheet doubles in thickness, bright debris and strands in the gaps, short cracks, small dark bubbles inside the sheet, uneven ply density, and all of them together.",
  "caption": "Synthetic demo: ScrollSim v2 sheet physics, each effect alone and all together, on one crop. Demo settings, not measurements. No scan data.",
